notation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-064-simadaozi-ws2622004"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin064-ru-father","subject_person_id":"8a8_1b6_zxp","object_person_id":"p0j_2w8_6mv","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"其子壽齡"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-simadaozi-ws2622004","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p005","quote":"又道子既為皇太妃所愛，親遇同家人之禮，遂恃寵乘酒，時失禮敬。帝益不能平，然乙太妃之故，加崇禮秩。博平令吳興聞人奭上疏曰：「驃騎諮議參軍茹千秋協輔宰相，起自微賤，竊弄威權，衒賣天官。其子壽齡為樂安令，贓私狼藉，畏法奔逃，竟無罪罰，傲然還縣。又尼姏屬類，傾動亂時。穀賤人饑，流殣不絕，由百姓單貧，役調深刻。又振武將軍庾恆鳴角京邑，主簿戴良夫苦諫被囚，殆至沒命。而恆以醉酒見怒，良夫以執忠廢棄。又權寵之臣，各開小府，施置吏佐，無益於官，有損于國。」疏奏，帝益不平，而逼於太妃，無所廢黜，乃出王恭為兗州，殷仲堪為荊州，王珣為僕射，王雅為太子少傳，以張王室，而潛制道子也。道子復委任王緒，由是朋黨競扇，友愛道盡。太妃每和解之，而道子不能改。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p005:m0092","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p005:m0067"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"聞人奭疏內稱。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p004:m0009","surface":"茹千秋","start":9,"end":12,"person_id":"p0j_2w8_6mv","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p005:m0067","surface":"茹千秋","start":67,"end":70,"person_id":"p0j_2w8_6mv","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin064-ru-father","subject_person_id":"8a8_1b6_zxp","object_person_id":"p0j_2w8_6mv","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"其子壽齡"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-simadaozi-ws2622004","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p005","quote":"又道子既為皇太妃所愛，親遇同家人之禮，遂恃寵乘酒，時失禮敬。帝益不能平，然乙太妃之故，加崇禮秩。博平令吳興聞人奭上疏曰：「驃騎諮議參軍茹千秋協輔宰相，起自微賤，竊弄威權，衒賣天官。其子壽齡為樂安令，贓私狼藉，畏法奔逃，竟無罪罰，傲然還縣。又尼姏屬類，傾動亂時。穀賤人饑，流殣不絕，由百姓單貧，役調深刻。又振武將軍庾恆鳴角京邑，主簿戴良夫苦諫被囚，殆至沒命。而恆以醉酒見怒，良夫以執忠廢棄。又權寵之臣，各開小府，施置吏佐，無益於官，有損于國。」疏奏，帝益不平，而逼於太妃，無所廢黜，乃出王恭為兗州，殷仲堪為荊州，王珣為僕射，王雅為太子少傳，以張王室，而潛制道子也。道子復委任王緒，由是朋黨競扇，友愛道盡。太妃每和解之，而道子不能改。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p005:m0092","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p005:m0067"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"聞人奭疏內稱。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p004","text":"嬖人趙牙出自優倡，茹千秋本錢塘捕賊吏，因賂諂進，道子以牙為魏郡太守，千秋驃騎諮議參軍。牙為道子開東第，築山穿池，列樹竹木，功用钜萬。道子使宮人為酒肆，沽賣于水側，與親昵乘船就之飲宴，以為笑樂。帝嘗幸其宅，謂道子曰：「府內有山，因得遊矚，甚善也。然修飾太過，非示天下以儉。」道子無以對，唯唯而已，左右侍臣莫敢有言。帝還宮，道子謂牙曰：「上若知山是板築所作，爾必死矣。」牙曰：「公在，牙何敢死！」營造彌甚。千秋賣官販爵，聚資貨累億。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":119,"last_line":119,"raw_start":8583,"raw_end":8799,"raw_character_offsets":[8585,8586,8587,8588,8589,8590,8591,8592,8593,8594,8595,8596,8597,8598,8599,8600,8601,8602,8603,8604,8605,8606,8607,8608,8609,8610,8611,8612,8613,8614,8615,8616,8617,8618,8619,8620,8621,8622,8623,8624,8625,